WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:03.569
-These are our favorite
jokes of the week.

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:04.604
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:05.938
President Trump said yesterday

00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:07.974
that he plans to deliver
his speech

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:10.109
accepting the Republican
nomination from either

00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:12.011
The White House
or the battlefield

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:13.880
at Gettysburg, Pennsylvania.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.915
Okay, do you really want
your speech

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:18.050
getting compared to
the Gettysburg Address?

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:19.185
It's like announcing
you're going to film

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:20.419
the next "American Pie" movie

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:22.388
on the same set as
"Citizen Kane."

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:25.558
A 103-year-old woman in Michigan
got a tattoo last week

00:00:25.558 --> 00:00:27.493
to check it off her bucket list.

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:30.663
Well, I just hope she doesn't
regret it when she gets older.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:33.032
Russian President Vladimir Putin
announced today

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:36.502
that his country's healthcare
regulators have approved

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:38.738
the world's first
coronavirus vaccine,

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:42.174
despite the drug not
undergoing clinical trials.

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:44.177
Though it's definitely
not the first time

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:45.578
Putin has skipped the trial.

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:47.480
[ Russian accent ] Guilty.
Take him to roof.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.082
A stunt double in England
recently set himself on fire

00:00:50.082 --> 00:00:51.317
to propose to his girlfriend,

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:53.552
so he's extremely romantic
and, bonus,

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:55.555
he already knows
how it feels to be married.

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.559 line:0%
♪♪

